    "Went back to New",
    "York. I like the law",
    "school very well so far.",
    "The cousins have all",
    "acted like trumps, and",
    "have sent Alice",
    "beautiful presents;",
    "Emlen a pearl ring,",
    "West a bracelet &c &c."
